# Protected Paths

## `sprites/`

- Do NOT bulk-regenerate, replace, or delete art assets
- Do NOT run image AI over existing sprites without explicit user request
- OK: add new icons following existing folder layout (`sprites/ui/skills/<class>/`)

## `user://`

- Player save directory — never commit to git
- Do not change save file path without migration
- Testing saves: use local `user://` only

## `project.godot`

- Autoload order matters: `AudioManager`, `ItemDatabase`, `SaveSystem`, `HeroEquipment`
- Change autoload section only with documented reason
- Display/rendering settings for overlay documented in `docs/architecture/overlay-desktop.md`

## Save version

- `VERSAO_SAVE` / `SAVE_VERSION` bump requires:
  1. Migration function in save service
  2. Update `docs/architecture/save-format.md`
  3. Manual load test from previous version

## Git

- No force-push to `main`
- Grep legacy `res://` paths before merge when moving files
